      "id": "p10-rectangle-root",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "",
      "prompt": "The perimeter of a rectangle is 56 cm. If the length of the rectangle is three times its breadth, determine the dimensions by setting up and solving two simultaneous equations.",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "p10-rectangle-step1",
          "type": "part",
          "label": "1",
          "prompt": "",
          "answerSpaceMm": 13,
          "answer": {
            "short": "Let $l$ be the length and $b$ be the breadth, both in centimetres.",
            "worked": "Let $l$ be the length and $b$ be the breadth, both in centimetres.",
            "provenance": {
              "short": "authored",
              "worked": "authored"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-rectangle-step2",
          "type": "part",
          "label": "2",
          "prompt": "",
          "answerSpaceMm": 15,
          "answer": {
            "short": "$2l+2b=56$ (1); $l=3b$ (2).",
            "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2l+2b&=56\\qquad (1)\\\\l&=3b\\qquad (2)\\end{align*}$$",
            "provenance": {
              "short": "authored",
              "worked": "authored"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-rectangle-step3",
          "type": "part",
          "label": "3",
          "prompt": "",
          "answerSpaceMm": 29,
          "answer": {
            "short": "$b=7$, $l=21$.",
            "worked": "Substitute (2) into (1).\n$$\\begin{align*}2(3b)+2b&=56\\\\8b&=56\\\\b&=7\\end{align*}$$\nSubstitute $b=7$ into (2).\n$$\\begin{align*}l&=3(7)\\\\l&=21\\end{align*}$$",
            "provenance": {
              "short": "authored",
              "worked": "authored"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-rectangle-step4",
          "type": "part",
          "label": "4",
